# Bench: `Array.foldl`, kernel form

`arrSum a`, whose source is `a.foldl (· + ·) 0`: `listFoldl` on `a.toList` in the kernel
form, core's `Array.foldl` (through `Array.foldlM`, quadratic in the kernel) in `Src.arrSum`.

Generated by `scripts/gen_bench.py`; metered by `scripts/kernel_cost.py`, with
`bench/ArrayFoldlSrc.lean` the same check through the readable definition. Not a library: run it with `lean`.
-/


